  "claim": "For every Sudoku grid L of order 9, the centered row-band/column-stack average P_rb^T E P_cs of E = L - 5J vanishes identically. This identity is not forced by the Latin-square axioms alone; the cyclic LS-9 is exhibited as an explicit counterexample. The same centered-sum argument is certified for a rectangular 2x3 Roku-Doku grid and for a non-Cartesian gerechte partition of cyclic LS-9 by broken diagonals.",
